{
  "iri": "http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_82960",
  "lang": "en",
  "description": [
    "A pyrimidone that is pyrimidin-4(3<em>H</em>)-one in which the hydrogens at positions 2, 3, 5 and 6 are replaced by 2-[(5-methyl-1,3,4-oxadiazole-2-carbonyl)amino]propan-2-yl, methyl, hydroxy, and <em>N</em>-[(4-fluorophenyl)methyl]aminoacyl groups, respectively. It is an antiretroviral drug used for treatment of HIV infection."
  ],
